# Playwright storage state holds LIVE session cookies (Google SID, reddit_session,
# itchio_token). Unrooted so it matches at ANY depth - the rooted form missed
# config/config/playwright_profiles/, leaving live sessions one `git add -A` from
# being committed (caught 2026-09-20).
**/playwright_profiles/
**/*storage_state*.json